{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t運輸署公布，下周一早上10時起，接受網約車駕駛許可證申請，不設名額上限。<br/>\n<br/>\n至於網約車車輛許可證，則計劃於明年初公開邀請申請，數目上限一萬個，超額會以抽籤形式分配。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T12:03:53.501433+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:42:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T20:37:53.621152+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:57:25.234971+00:00","content_hash":"da430e45ccf051936bb2a8be339f2012ccc8ad112ab3c3d782c5e3e79d4d2271","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}